       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.       TSTRACT.
       AUTHOR.           DAVE PLUM.
       DATE-WRITTEN.     14 NOVEMBER 1996.
       INSTALLATION.     THE GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER COMPANY - AKRON.
      ******************************************************************
      * THIS PROGRAM WILL READ THROUGH THE MONTH-TO-DATE CSAS
      * TRANSACTION FILE (DTRANS - MCFPCA0700) AND WRITE SELECTED
      * RECORDS TO FILE STRACT01.
      *
      * THE ORIGINAL REQUEST FOR THIS PROGRAM CAME FROM UNION CITY.
      * IN UNION CITY, THEY REQUESTED THIS TYPE OF DATA ALONG WITH
      * ANOTHER FILE OF REQUSITION DATA IN ORDER TO FEED A BUDGET VS.
      * ACTUAL SYSTEM WHICH THEY DEVELOPED.
      ******************************************************************
      *C  15NOV1996    DAVE PLUM
      *C     REVISED FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C
      *C  25FEB1997    DAVE PLUM
      *C     REVISED PROGRAM TO SELECT RECORDS FROM THE DTRANS DATASET
      *C     BASED ON THE CURRENT ACCOUNTING MONTH AND YEAR (FROM
      *C     MACCTINFO), INSTEAD OF USING THE CURRENT DATE.
      *C
      *C  12NOV1998    JIM COFFMAN
      *C     REVISED PROGRAM TO SELECT RECORDS FROM THE DTRANS DATASET
      *C     BASED ON THE CURRENT MONTH END DATE AND TIME. IT WAS
      *C     DISCOVERED THAT THE CHECKBOOK PROGRAMS WERE COMING UP
      *C     WITH DIFFERENT VALUES FOR THE WITHDRAWAL NUMBERS. I TRACED
      *C     A PORTION OF THE DISCREPANCY TO THOSE 'ISS ' AND 'ISSI'
      *C     TRANSACTIONS THAT OCCURRED FROM THE USER'S MONTH END CUTOFF
      *C     TIME TO THE CURRENT MONTH (E.G. RECORDS THAT OCCURRED IN
      *C     DANVILLE AFTER CUTOFF 10/31/98 18:30:00 TO MIDNIGHT OF
      *C     NOVEMBER).
      *C
      *C  26APR1999    JIM COFFMAN
      *C     CHANGED THE DATE THAT GETS WRITTEN TO STRACT01 TO THE
      *C     BEGINNING DATE OF THE MONTH IF THE PLANT IS DOING A
      *C     CUTOFF PRIOR TO THE ACTUAL END OF THE MONTH SO THAT THE
      *C     ENGINEERING PEOPLE DO NOT HAVE TO INCLUDE THAT PORTION
      *C     OF DATA IN THE R105 REPORT. FOR EXAMPLE, DANVILLE CUTS
      *C     OFF THEIR MONTH END ON THE LAST DAY OF THE MONTH AT
      *C     18:30. ANY RECORDS THAT GET WRITTEN BETWEEN 18:30 AND
      *C     24:00 HOURS SHOULD NOW HAVE THE DATE CHANGED FROM 3/31
      *C     TO 04/01, OR 4/30 TO 05/01, ETC.
      *C
      *C  24MAR2000    JIM COFFMAN
      *C     UPDATED 3/26/99 LOGIC FOR LAWTON AS THEY WERE NOT ALWAYS
      *C     GETTING THEIR MONTH END TRANSACTIONS BETWEEN 190000 HOURS
      *C     AND 200000 HOURS INCLUDED.
      *C
      *C  03MAY2000    JIM COFFMAN
      *C     ADDED READ OF CSAS FILE MCHT-ACCTS (MCFLCA0301) TO LOGIC
      *C     WHEN I TRACED THAT TSUMCHGS WAS DOING SOME "MAGIC" TO
      *C     ALTER EXPENSE CLASSES OF '000000' FOR NON-STOREROOM
      *C     DEPARTMENTS. THE LOGIC IN TSUMCHGS IS IF THE LAST 3 DIGITS
      *C     OF EXPENSE ARE '000' AND/OR THE 4TH DIGIT IS A '2' OR '9'
      *C     MOVE '200' TO EXPENSE ELSE '250' FOR DEPARTMENTS NOT
      *C     LABELLED 'MV' OR "MS' IN THE DEPARTMENT TYPE FIELD OF
      *C     MCHT-ACCTS.
      *C
      *C  04MAY2000    JIM COFFMAN
      *C     ADDED FIX TO HANDLE DISCREPANCY FOUND BETWEEN TSUMCHGS
      *C     LOGIC AND THIS PROGRAM'S IN HANDLING 'AADJ' TRANSACTIONS.
      *C     CHECKBOOK'S CSAS VS. BUDGET WAS INCLUDING 'AADJ'
      *C     TRANSACTIONS THAT WERE GENERATED PRIOR TO MONTH END
      *C     CLOSING YET WERE OUTSIDE THE REALM OF THIS PROGRAM AS
      *C     IT RESTRICTED TRANSACTIONS TO ESSENTIALLY A MONTH
      *C     (LAST MONTH END CLOSING DATE TO THIS MONTH'S CLOSING DATE).
      *C
      *C  06FEBRUARY2001 JE COFFMAN
      *C     ADDED MCDATRANGE LOGIC TO THIS PROGRAM SO THAT A STARTING
      *C     LOW DATE AND ENDING HIGH DATE CAN BE SET SO THAT THE USER
      *C     CAN ABSTRACT A SPECIFIC DATE RANGE OF INFORMATION FROM THE
      *C     TRANSACTION RECORDS IN MCFPCA077 AND WRITE THEM TO FILE
      *C     STRACT01 FOR SUBSEQUENT TRANSFER TO THE FPSTRACT FILE OF
      *C     THE CHECKBOOK SYSTEM. THIS LOGIC WAS INCLUDED WHEN IT WAS
      *C     DISCOVERED IN UNION CITY THAT THEIR MACCT-PREV-MNTH-DATE
      *C     HAD GOTTEN SKEWED SOMEHOW.
      *C
001300 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001400 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001500 SOURCE-COMPUTER.      AS-400.
001600 OBJECT-COMPUTER.      AS-400.
       COPY SPECIALN IN COPYLIB.
001800
001900 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
002000 FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DATRANGE
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCDATRANGE
                  ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
                  ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DTRANS-MC-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0701
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DTRANS-OUT
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-STRACT01
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MACCOUNT-INFO
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0101
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MCHT-ACCTS
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0301
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MPLTINFO
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

002500 DATA DIVISION.
002700 FILE SECTION.
       FD  DATRANGE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS DATRANGE-REC.
       01  DATRANGE-REC.
           05  DATE-START        PIC X(8).
           05  DATE-STOP         PIC X(8).

       FD  DTRANS-MC-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DTRANS-MC-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCA0700  OF MCFLCA0701.

       FD  DTRANS-OUT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DTRANS-OUT-REC.
          COPY DDS-STRACT01  OF STRACT01.

       FD  MACCOUNT-INFO
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS MACCOUNT-INFO-REC.
       01  MACCOUNT-INFO-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCA0100  OF MCFLCA0101.

       FD  MCHT-ACCTS
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MCHT-ACCTS-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCA0300  OF MCFLCA0301.

       FD  MPLTINFO
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500  OF MCFLCS0501.

006500 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
010500
       01  COMPARE-DATE-TIME-WA.
           05  DATE-TIME-LO-WA.
               10  DATE-LO-WA.
                   15  DATE-LO-WA-CC     PIC XX.
                   15  DATE-LO-WA-YYMMDD.
                       20  DATE-LO-WA-YY PIC XX.
                       20  DATE-LO-WA-MM PIC XX.
                       20  DATE-LO-WA-DD PIC XX.
               10  TIME-LO-WA            PIC X(6).
           05  DATE-TIME-HI-WA.
               10  DATE-HI-WA.
                   15  DATE-HI-WA-CC     PIC XX.
                   15  DATE-HI-WA-YYMMDD.
                       20  DATE-HI-WA-YY PIC XX.
                       20  FILLER        PIC X(4).
               10  TIME-HI-WA            PIC X(6).

022800 COPY DTRANS IN COPYLIB.
022900
       01  OVRDBF-PARM1  PIC X(80) VALUE SPACES.
       01  OVRDBF-PARM2  PIC S9(10)V9(5) COMP-3 VALUE 80.

       01  WS-DTRANS-OUT-REC.
           05 WS-DOR-DATE.
              10 WS-DOR-DATE-CC          PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
              10 WS-DOR-DATE-YYMMDD.
                 15  WS-DOR-DATE-YY      PIC 9(2).
                 15  WS-DOR-DATE-MM      PIC 9(2).
                 15  WS-DOR-DATE-DD      PIC 9(2).
           05 WS-DOR-CLASS               PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-DOR-DEPT                PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-DOR-EXPENSE             PIC X(6)  VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-DOR-CORPCODE            PIC X(7)  VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-DOR-TRANS-CODE          PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-DOR-EMPLOYEE            PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-DOR-QTY                 PIC S9(10) VALUE +0.
           05 WS-DOR-VALUE               PIC S9(8)V9(2) VALUE +0.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(24) VALUE SPACES.

       COPY MACTINFO IN COPYLIB.

       COPY MCHTACCT IN COPYLIB.

       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1    PIC X(1) VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2    PIC X(1) VALUE "0".

       COPY DBSTAT IN COPYLIB.

       01  COUNTERS.
           05  RECS-READ        PIC S9(11) COMP-3 VALUE +0.
           05  RECS-WRITTEN     PIC S9(11) COMP-3 VALUE +0.

      ***********************************************************
      * 25FEB1997 REPLACED THE FOLLOWING BLOCK OF CODE
      ***********************************************************
       COPY TDATECHK IN COPYLIB.

       01  TODAYS-DATE.
           05  TODAYS-DATE-CCYYMM.
               10  TODAYS-DATE-CC       PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
               10  TODAYS-DATE-YY       PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
               10  TODAYS-DATE-MM       PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
               10  TODAYS-DATE-MM-9 REDEFINES TODAYS-DATE-MM
                                        PIC 99.
           05  TODAYS-DATE-DD           PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.

       01  TODAYS-DATE-2 REDEFINES TODAYS-DATE.
           05    FILLER                 PIC X(2).
           05  TODAYS-DATE-YYMMDD       PIC X(6).
      ***********************************************************
      *
      *01  CURRENT-ACCTG-CCYYMM.
      *    05  CURRENT-ACCTG-CC         PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
      *    05  CURRENT-ACCTG-YY         PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
      *    05  CURRENT-ACCTG-MM         PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.

       01  HOLD-DATE.
           05  HOLD-DATE-CCYYMM         PIC X(6) VALUE SPACES.
           05    FILLER                 PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.

       COPY TBLOWUP IN COPYLIB.

       01  DUMMY-DB               PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.

       01  MCXCBLERR-SCOPE       PIC X(1)  VALUE "C".

       01  MACCT-ARG             PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.

       COPY MPLT0   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY MPLTP01 IN COPYLIB.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       000-MAINLINE.
           PERFORM 1-HOUSEKEEPING THRU 1-HOUSEKEEPING-X.
           PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-MAIN-X
              UNTIL BUF-DTRANS EQUAL HIGH-VALUES.
           PERFORM 2-EOJ THRU 2-EOJ-X.
           GOBACK.

       1-HOUSEKEEPING.
           OPEN I-O    DATRANGE.
           MOVE "C" TO MCXCBLERR-SCOPE.
           CALL "MCXCBLERR" USING MCXCBLERR-SCOPE.

      ***************************************************
      * 25FEB1997 REPLACED THE FOLLOWING BLOCK OF CODE
      ***************************************************
      ***************************************************
      * 04MAY2000 RE-OPENED RETRIEVING THE CURRENT DATE
      *           SO THAT 'AADJ' TRANSACTION CHECKING
      *           COULD BE PERFORMED.
      ***************************************************
           MOVE 1 TO DATE-MODE.
           CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA.
           MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT TO TODAYS-DATE-YYMMDD.

           IF TODAYS-DATE-YY > "70"
               MOVE "19" TO TODAYS-DATE-CC
           ELSE
               MOVE "20" TO TODAYS-DATE-CC.

           IF TODAYS-DATE-DD = "01"
               IF TODAYS-DATE-MM = "01"
                   MOVE "12" TO TODAYS-DATE-MM
               ELSE
               SUBTRACT 1 FROM TODAYS-DATE-MM-9.

           DISPLAY "TODAYS-DATE        = ", TODAYS-DATE.
      *****DISPLAY "TODAYS-DATE-CCYYMM = ", TODAYS-DATE-CCYYMM.
      ***************************************************

           OPEN INPUT   DTRANS-MC-I, MACCOUNT-INFO, MPLTINFO,
                        MCHT-ACCTS
                OUTPUT  DTRANS-OUT.

           MOVE "P 01" TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO INTO BUF-MPLTINFO.

           READ DATRANGE
               AT END    MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF DATRANGE-REC = SPACES
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           MOVE DATE-START     TO  DATE-LO-WA
           MOVE ZEROES         TO  TIME-LO-WA
           MOVE DATE-STOP      TO  DATE-HI-WA
           MOVE "235959"       TO  TIME-HI-WA
           DISPLAY "DRANGE FROM FILE = " COMPARE-DATE-TIME-WA
           GO TO 1-HOUSEKEEPING-CONT.
      *    MOVE "MY" TO MACCT-ARG.
      *    MOVE MACCT-ARG TO INFOKEY OF MACCOUNT-INFO-REC.
      *    READ MACCOUNT-INFO INTO BUF-MACCT-INFO
      *        INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
      *    IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
      *        MOVE "READ MACTINFO - MY" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
      *        PERFORM 10-BLOWUP THRU 10-BLOWUP-X.
      *
      *    MOVE MACCT-MONTH    TO  CURRENT-ACCTG-MM.
      *    MOVE MACCT-YEAR     TO  CURRENT-ACCTG-YY.
      *
      *    IF CURRENT-ACCTG-YY > "70"
      *        MOVE "19"       TO  CURRENT-ACCTG-CC
      *    ELSE
      *        MOVE "20"       TO  CURRENT-ACCTG-CC.
      *
      *    DISPLAY "CURRENT-ACCTG-CCYYMM = ", CURRENT-ACCTG-CCYYMM.

           MOVE "MTED"         TO MACCT-ARG.
           MOVE MACCT-ARG TO INFOKEY OF MACCOUNT-INFO-REC.
           READ MACCOUNT-INFO INTO BUF-MACCT-INFO
               INVALID KEY    MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "READ MACTINFO - MTED" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 10-BLOWUP THRU 10-BLOWUP-X.

           MOVE MACCT-PREV-MTH-END-DATE TO DATE-LO-WA-YYMMDD.
      *    IF DATE-LO-WA-MM > TODAYS-DATE-MM
      *        MOVE TODAYS-DATE-MM TO DATE-LO-WA-MM.
           MOVE "01"     TO DATE-LO-WA-DD.
      *    ADDED LINE ABOVE WHEN IT WAS DISCOVERED THAT DECATUR WAS
      *    ACTUALLY CLOSING BEFORE THE DATE THAT THEY HAD SPECIFIED
      *    TO CUTOFF AND RECORDS FROM THE CLOSING DATE TO THE DATE
      *    THAT WAS SPECIFIED TO CLOSE DID NOT GET PASSED TO CHECKBOOK.
           IF DATE-LO-WA-YY > "70"
               MOVE "19" TO DATE-LO-WA-CC
           ELSE
           MOVE "20"     TO DATE-LO-WA-CC.
           MOVE MACCT-PREV-MTH-END-TIME TO TIME-LO-WA.
           MOVE MACCT-MONTH-END-DATE    TO DATE-HI-WA-YYMMDD.
           IF DATE-HI-WA-YY > "70"
               MOVE "19" TO DATE-HI-WA-CC
           ELSE
           MOVE "20"     TO DATE-HI-WA-CC.
           MOVE MACCT-MONTH-END-TIME    TO TIME-HI-WA.

           DISPLAY "COMPARE DATE AREA = " COMPARE-DATE-TIME-WA.

       1-HOUSEKEEPING-CONT.
           MOVE SPACES TO MATLCODE OF DTRANS-MC-REC-I.
           START DTRANS-MC-I KEY >= MATLCODE OF DTRANS-MC-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           PERFORM 3-READ-DTRANS THRU 3-READ-DTRANS.

       1-HOUSEKEEPING-X.
           EXIT.

       10-BLOWUP.
           MOVE "TSTRACT" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING  DUMMY-DB, BU-PGM-NAME,
                          STATUS-AREA, DUMMY-VIEW-AREA,
                          FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG, BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.

       10-BLOWUP-X.
           EXIT.


       2-EOJ.
           CLOSE DTRANS-MC-I, DTRANS-OUT, MACCOUNT-INFO,
               MCHT-ACCTS, DATRANGE.
           MOVE "CLRPFM FILE(*LIBL/MCDATRANGE)" TO OVRDBF-PARM1.
           CALL "QCMDEXC" USING OVRDBF-PARM1, OVRDBF-PARM2.
           DISPLAY "TOTAL RECORDS READ    = ", RECS-READ.
           DISPLAY "TOTAL RECORDS WRITTEN = ", RECS-WRITTEN.

       2-EOJ-X.
           EXIT.

       3-READ-DTRANS.
           READ DTRANS-MC-I NEXT INTO  BUF-DTRANS
              AT END MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO BUF-DTRANS.
           IF FILE-STATUS EQUAL "00"
               ADD 1 TO RECS-READ
           ELSE
               IF BUF-DTRANS NOT EQUAL HIGH-VALUES
                   MOVE "READ DTRANS * 3-READ" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   PERFORM 10-BLOWUP THRU 10-BLOWUP-X.

       3-READ-DTRANS-X.
           EXIT.

       4-WRITE.
           WRITE DTRANS-OUT-REC FROM WS-DTRANS-OUT-REC.
           ADD 1 TO RECS-WRITTEN.

       4-WRITE-X.
           EXIT.

       6-MAIN.
      *------ SELECT CURRENT MONTH RECORDS FOR SELECTED TRANS CODES
      *    MOVE TRANS-DATE-CN TO HOLD-DATE.

      *****IF HOLD-DATE-CCYYMM = TODAYS-DATE-CCYYMM *REPLACED 25FEB1997*

           IF TRANS-DATE-CN = DATE-LO-WA
               IF DATE-LO-WA-DD > "27"
                   MOVE DATE-HI-WA      TO TRANS-DATE-CN
                   MOVE "01"            TO TRANS-DD.

      *    IF HOLD-DATE-CCYYMM = CURRENT-ACCTG-CCYYMM
           IF TRANS-CODE = "AADJ"
             IF TRANS-DATE-TIME NOT LESS THAN DATE-TIME-LO-WA
               AND TRANS-DATE-TIME NOT GREATER THAN TODAYS-DATE
                 PERFORM 61-MOVE-FIELDS THRU 61-MOVE-FIELDS-X
                 PERFORM 4-WRITE        THRU 4-WRITE-X
             ELSE
             NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF TRANS-DATE-TIME NOT LESS THAN DATE-TIME-LO-WA
             AND TRANS-DATE-TIME NOT GREATER THAN DATE-TIME-HI-WA
               IF TRANS-CODE = "RET "
                            OR "RETV"
                            OR "SADJ"
      *                     OR "AADJ"
                   PERFORM 61-MOVE-FIELDS THRU 61-MOVE-FIELDS-X
                   PERFORM 4-WRITE THRU 4-WRITE-X
               ELSE
               IF TRANS-CODE-TRANS = "ISS"
                   PERFORM 61-MOVE-FIELDS THRU 61-MOVE-FIELDS-X
                   PERFORM 4-WRITE THRU 4-WRITE-X.

           PERFORM 3-READ-DTRANS THRU 3-READ-DTRANS-X.

       6-MAIN-X.
           EXIT.

       61-MOVE-FIELDS.
      *    IF TRANS-DATE-CN = DATE-LO-WA
      *        MOVE DATE-HI-WA          TO TRANS-DATE-CN
      *        MOVE "01"                TO TRANS-DD.
           MOVE TRANS-DATE-CN           TO WS-DOR-DATE.
      *    IF TRANS-TIME > TIME-LO-WA
      *        AND TRANS-TIME < "240000"
      *            MOVE 01              TO WS-DOR-DATE-DD.
           MOVE TRANS-CLASS             TO WS-DOR-CLASS.
           MOVE TRANS-DEPT              TO WS-DOR-DEPT
                                           DEPT OF MCHT-ACCTS-REC.
           READ MCHT-ACCTS INTO BUF-MCHTACCTS.
           IF MCHT-DEPT-TYPE = "MS" OR "MV"
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF TRANS-ACCT-SPLIT = "000"
               MOVE "000200"            TO TRANS-ACCT
           ELSE
           IF TRANS-ACCT-SPLIT < "100" OR TRANS-ACCT-1 = "2" OR "9"
               MOVE "000250"            TO TRANS-ACCT.
           MOVE TRANS-ACCT              TO WS-DOR-EXPENSE.
           MOVE TRANS-STORES-CODE       TO WS-DOR-CORPCODE.
           MOVE TRANS-CODE              TO WS-DOR-TRANS-CODE.
           MOVE TRANS-EMP               TO WS-DOR-EMPLOYEE.
      *    MOVE TRANS-QTY               TO WS-DOR-QTY.

      *----- REVERSE THE SIGN FOR "RET", "RETV", "SADJ", AND "AADJ"
      *----- TRANSACTIONS WHEN REPORTING THE VALUE FIELD.
      *----- THIS WILL ALLOW FOR THE "CHARGE" TO THE DEPARTMENT TO
      *----- BE TAKEN FROM THIS FILE AS IS.  IN CSAS A RETURN OF
      *----- 1 UNIT WITH A VALUE OF $5.00 WOULD EXIST IN DTRANS
      *----- WITH A VALUE GREATER THAN ZER0.  BY REVERSING THE
      *----- SIGN IN THE OUTPUT FILE TO BE $5.00-, THIS VALUE CAN
      *----- MORE EASILY BE COMBINED WITH "ISS" TRANSACTIONS TO
      *----- DETERMINE THE TOTAL/NET "CHARGE" TO AN ACCOUNTING ENTITY
      *----- SUCH AS A DEPARTMENT.

           IF TRANS-CODE = "RET " OR "RETV" OR "SADJ" OR "AADJ"
               COMPUTE WS-DOR-VALUE = TRANS-VALUE * -1
               COMPUTE WS-DOR-QTY = TRANS-QTY * -1
           ELSE
               MOVE TRANS-VALUE         TO WS-DOR-VALUE
               MOVE TRANS-QTY           TO WS-DOR-QTY.

       61-MOVE-FIELDS-X.
           EXIT.
